            <symbol type="2" id="143" code="518" name="Uncrossable fence or railing">
                <description>An uncrossable fence or railing shall not be crossed, because it may constitute a danger to the competitor due to its height or due to the risk of damage to private property or the fence itself. If the minimum length is shorter than 3 mm,
it must be presented with the symbol Uncrossable wall (515).

Minimum length (isolated): 3 mm (footprint 12 m).</description>
